# Power BI local state — machine-specific, rewritten on every open, save and
# refresh. The `**/` prefix matters: a pattern containing a slash is anchored
# to the repo root, and these files live under each .Report / .SemanticModel
# folder, so the un-prefixed form never matched them.
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf

# Desktop binaries. The .pbip projects are the source of truth; the web copies
# are downloads from the service.
*.pbix
